e, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "1 · Paper Related: venues and related papers"}, {"id": "kept_s-4a5267123f7d", "type": "text", "x": 1475.0, "y": 452.5, "width": 1138.5, "height": 58.50000000000001, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-3e8aa5a1a3ba", "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "s04 · Paper Related: venues and related papers", "originalText": "s04 · Paper Related: venues and related papers", "fontSize": 45, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "kept_s-54cc0a10116e", "type": "text", "x": 1475.0, "y": 577.5, "width": 1588.125, "height": 273.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-3e8aa5a1a3ba", "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "what a paper Board sits beside. The Board keeps the related work and stays venue-free (s01-D01, D02); each\nversion Job is attached to one venue (s01-D03). The Block's `related/` shelf (b10 s01-D34) holds one table,\n`related/related.md` (kind · date · item · link · feeds · group), and its subfolders meetings/ · papers/ ·\nfiles/ · emails/, each kept as it came (/haipipe-related). A row's groups on the Studio's bar are its\nsubfolder first, then its `group` cell, comma-separated, a paper's research questions among them (b10 s04-D07,\nD08, D09). This topic settles where venues and related papers go on that shelf, and who writes them. Its\ndecisions start at s04-D06: s04-D01..D05 are the retired Story decisions, kept by their old ids in s01's\nnotes.", "originalText": "what a paper Board sits beside. The Board keeps the related work and stays venue-free (s01-D01, D02); each\nversion Job is attached to one venue (s01-D03). The Block's `related/` shelf (b10 s01-D34) holds one table,\n`related/related.md` (kind · date · item · link · feeds · group), and its subfolders meetings/ · papers/ ·\nfiles/ · emails/, each kept as it came (/haipipe-related). A row's groups on the Studio's bar are its\nsubfolder first, then its `group` cell, comma-separated, a paper's research questions among them (b10 s04-D07,\nD08, D09). This topic settles where venues and related papers go on that shelf, and who writes them. Its\ndecisions start at s04-D06: s04-D01..D05 are the retired Story decisions, kept by their old ids in s01's\nnotes.", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "kept_s-a1266ca7b89d", "type": "text", "x": 1475.0, "y": 977.5, "width": 115.5, "height": 39.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-3e8aa5a1a3ba", "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ON DISK", "originalText": "ON DISK", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "kept_s-cbc9d049c32a", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1475.0, "y": 1027.5, "width": 1375.0, "height": 375.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-3e8aa5a1a